== test_reap_is_provably_bounded
ok - reap is provably bounded (a TERM-ignoring child is forced inside the window and reported; a child that exits on TERM is collected silently)
wall 20.83s
exit 0
== test_stop_terminates_a_poll_in_flight
ok - a stop delivered while a check is in flight terminates the watcher on the first TERM and takes the check with it
wall 2.15s
exit 0
